  "releaseNotes": "1.1.3: BREAKING — Product.Upc / ProductRequest.Upc changed from int to string? (update callers that assign/compare Upc as int). Also adds shipping dimension fields to product models.\n1.1.2: Local packaging of UPC string alignment and shipping fields (superseded by 1.1.3 for nuget.org).\n1.1.1: Document retailer verification for live product writes (HTTP 403 when unverified); clarify test API key bypass.\n1.1.0: Add deal management support (DealService, Deal, DealRequest).\n1.0.0: First stable release with product CRUD and Response<T> error handling.",
